@startuml
title UML - Exact-scope independent report revision and publication recovery
actor "Finance maker" as maker
actor "Independent Finance checker" as checker
participant "Workforce / BFF" as api
participant "Finance revisions" as finance
database "Finance store" as fs
participant "Controls" as controls
participant "Finance recovery worker" as worker
maker -> api : choose original + later report, exact reason, request UUID
api -> finance : verified workforce / Origin / CSRF
finance -> controls : current Finance maker role and REVIEW queue
finance -> fs : verify both immutable artifacts, digests and retained source membership
finance -> fs : commit sealed revision request / maker / expiry / audit intent
finance --> maker : 202 accepted original request ID
worker -> fs : bounded cursor page (advance past blocked makers)
worker -> controls : same request ID; FINANCE_REPORT purpose\noriginal resource / exact digest / maker / expiry
controls -x worker : registration acknowledgment lost after commit
worker -> controls : repeat exact original registration
controls --> worker : same proposal; no duplicate audit event
worker -> fs : registration acknowledgment linked
checker -> api : review both artifacts and confirm exact revision digest
api -> finance : approval of original request
finance -> controls : current approver / APPROVE queue; distinct canonical person
controls -> controls : lock proposal and recheck authority / independence / expiry
controls --> finance : exact original proposal approved
maker -> api : publish same approved revision digest
api -> finance : original canonical maker
finance -> fs : lock original report / sealed request
finance -> controls : exact approved purpose / resource / digest\ncurrent independent checker and queue
finance -> fs : unique predecessor/successor receipt + audit atomically
note over finance,fs
Artifact/source times prevent cycles.
Both original report documents and digests remain immutable.
No Core money command is available to publication.
end note
finance -x maker : publication acknowledgment lost after commit
maker -> finance : replay same request and digest with current authority
finance -> fs : recover immutable original publication receipt
finance --> maker : same reports / people / publication time
@enduml
